  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305"
      }
     ],
     "value": "There are 3 copies of the NOMO gene on chromosome 16p12-p13: NOMO1 (AC Q15155), NOMO2 and NOMO3 (AC P69849). All 3 are extremely similar, which makes their individual characterization difficult. Thus, most experiments probably do not discriminate between the different members. The results reported in other entries may therefore apply for this protein"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "CAUTION"
